    "answer": {
      "short": "96 goals",
      "worked": "The ‘part’ is $\\frac{1}{6}$ of the team’s goals.\n\n1 part is 16 goals.\n\n6 parts is $16\\times6=96$ goals.\n\nHence, the team scored 96 goals.",
